WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.367
-Welcome back, everybody.
We're hanging out with Lucy Liu.

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:06.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.801 --> 00:00:10.267
And it's time for a "Lip Flip."
Here we go.

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:12.400
-♪ It's a lip flip ♪

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.567
♪ When you flip your lip ♪

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:19.033
♪ It's a lip flip, yeah ♪

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:21.534
-Hi, everybody.
I'm Lucy Liu, and this is how

00:00:21.534 --> 00:00:25.067
I really talk
because I'm from New York.

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:29.467
And when I'm back in New York,
this is how I talk.

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:32.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.234 --> 00:00:35.634
-[ Speaks China ]
What's up, Jimmy Fallon.

00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:37.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:40.033
And I'm the host of
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:42.400
You can see me every night
on your telly,

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.200
and don't forget to watch me
on YouTube.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.868 --> 00:00:49.567
-Listen up, brother!

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:50.801
Oh, yeah!

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:53.901
I'm in the "Shazam!" movie,
yes I am.

00:00:53.901 --> 00:00:55.467
This movie rocks!

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:59.467
So, buckle up muchacho, because
it's going to be shazam!

00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:02.100
Bam!
Thank you ma'am!

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:05.701 --> 00:01:07.934
-I can't wait to see it.

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:11.901
It's gonna have action
and suspense and fights

00:01:11.901 --> 00:01:13.734
and explosions.

00:01:13.734 --> 00:01:18.567
"Shazam's" gonna be bigger
and better than ever!

00:01:18.567 --> 00:01:19.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.734 --> 00:01:21.234
[ Laughs ]

00:01:21.234 --> 00:01:22.367
-Sorry.

00:01:22.367 --> 00:01:23.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:25.367
Hey, watch this, Jimmy.

00:01:25.367 --> 00:01:29.234
I'm gonna do my Adam Sandler
impression for you.

00:01:29.234 --> 00:01:31.634
[ Speaking gibberish ]

00:01:31.634 --> 00:01:34.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.868 --> 00:01:38.100
-[ Speaking Gibberish ]

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.467
Shut up!

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:41.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:43.400
[ Laughs ]

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:49.434
-Oh, also Jimmy, I forgot to
mention that "Shazam!"

00:01:49.434 --> 00:01:52.000
has a lot of action
and it's funny,

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.834
but it's also really scary.

00:02:00.567 --> 00:02:02.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.467 --> 00:02:05.767
-Did somebody say scary?

00:02:05.767 --> 00:02:09.868
Wah-ha-ha-ha-ha!

00:02:09.868 --> 00:02:11.734
-Hey.
I got an idea.

00:02:11.734 --> 00:02:13.434
Why don't you start beat-boxing,

00:02:13.434 --> 00:02:17.400
and I'll do a "Shazam!"
rap over it?

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.300
-[ Beat boxing ]

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:25.667
♪♪

00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:27.968
-♪ I like shazam
and I cannot lie ♪

00:02:27.968 --> 00:02:30.200
♪ Lucy Liu and Zack Levi ♪

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.801
♪ And when those dragons fly in
with a super angry face ♪

00:02:32.801 --> 00:02:34.601
♪ Helen Mirren drops
in from space ♪

00:02:34.601 --> 00:02:36.033
♪ You'll have fun ♪

00:02:36.033 --> 00:02:37.734
♪ Shazam is back ♪

00:02:37.734 --> 00:02:38.901
♪ Shazam is back ♪

00:02:38.901 --> 00:02:40.834
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

00:02:40.834 --> 00:02:42.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:42.434 --> 00:02:44.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.801 --> 00:02:47.467
That's all the time we have
for "Lip Flip."

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:48.601
I love you.

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:51.501
Our thanks to our pal, Lucy Liu.
You're the best.

00:02:51.501 --> 00:02:53.634
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody.

